<header class="demo-header">
  <h1><%= @frame.name %></h1>
  <p>
    The same demo orders, but this dashboard is rows in the database rather than ERB: the grid,
    the order of the panes and how wide each one is all come from the records. Click any value to
    cross-filter, exactly as on the <%= link_to "hand written page", root_path %>.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="demo-frame">
  <%= janela_frame @frame, where: @fixed %>
</div>

<footer class="demo-footer">
  <p>Janela is an open source Rails engine. <a href="https://github.com/retail-tasker/janela">Source, README and decisions on GitHub</a>.</p>
</footer>
